1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,020
Good morning. He has something he wants to say about school shootings. Here is his extra point.

2
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:11,140
Another high school shooting yesterday, this one in Florida. 17 dead, the last report I saw.

3
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:15,360
And everybody sends their thoughts and prayers again because that works so well.

4
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:21,040
This is the 18th high school shooting in America this year, and we have 10 and a half months to go.

5
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:28,000
We've had 290 since 2013. We average about one a week, but there's just nothing we can do.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:35,320
If there was a Muslim or a Mexican doing the shooting, how many new laws and how much money would we spend then to stop the madness?

7
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:40,360
But since it's almost always a white kid, there's just nothing we can do.

8
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:47,240
America has 5% of the world's population and yet 31% of the world's mass shootings.

9
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:52,020
We're worried about people coming to this country. They should be worried about us going to theirs.

10
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:56,160
Australia had four mass shootings between 87 and 96.

11
00:00:56,480 --> 00:01:00,920
They passed stricter gun laws and haven't had a single mass shooting since.

12
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:05,920
And here I thought, guns don't kill, people do. Is this the people we are?

13
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:11,220
Last time I said we need to find a way to stop a nut with a gun, and that's all I said.

14
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:16,120
I get an email saying, I'm saving my last bullet to put it right between your eyes.

15
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:22,260
Just another responsible gun owner in America, and I'm taking all bets, he's a white guy.

16
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:25,200
So there's just nothing we can do.

17
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:29,940
I'm Dale Hanson. It's getting harder to enjoy the day.

18
00:01:29,940 --> 00:01:30,580
Thank you.

19
00:01:30,580 --> 00:01:31,140
Thank you.

20
00:01:31,140 --> 00:01:31,200
Thank you.

